{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8ae45d48fbb31b0d8531d8f6ad7fe3947763d9a1317a36ce51efbb9027292d22", "ja": "（ジュリアの姿が見えないと思っていたら、\n屋上に呼び出された。急にどうしたんだろう？）", "zh": "（我还在想怎么没看到茱莉亚，结果被叫到了楼顶。突然这是怎么了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "52773caeeceea3e4d10e8542e74be89224b890522ee104362acdc5af87981529", "ja": "お、{$P$}。\nやっと来たな。", "zh": "哦，{$P$}。\n你终于来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2ef23390449542cda05e802d081c3f585a6e0d366b504964f71ca58f05de2549", "ja": "お疲れさま、ジュリア。いきなり\n屋上なんかに呼び出して、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，茱莉亚。突然把我叫到天台来，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "27c1c56aa67b53cb9471ba13196ca3bf18f75745cfa6640a630d7184e6c86a93", "ja": "別に……星を見てただけだよ。\nほら、ここからだとよく見えるだろ？", "zh": "没什么……只是看看星星而已。\n你看，从这里看得很清楚吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "34af8d3c5393ef6714105c8b0f728af40ffe5710572765a91bc6d208957ec259", "ja": "綺麗だから、あんたも来るかと思って誘ったんだ。", "zh": "因为很漂亮，我想着你可能也会想来，所以就邀请你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1005_p", "source_sha256": "440f3d48c8af7befbad36780e73ce80d23fbf5fb055548558b7ee4e7b4438ac0", "ja": "確かに、少し空が近く感じるな。……けど、\n本当にそれだけか？　何か悩みがあるとか……。", "zh": "确实，感觉天空近了一些。……不过，\n真的只是这样吗？是不是有什么烦恼……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "8043ee43a53733d99af8fbc36dbdc11223bed33975d45e4e30f247e6bcbc345c", "ja": "ないって。{$P$}も知ってるだろ？\nあたしは元気だって。", "zh": "没有啦。{$P$}也知道的吧？我可是很有精神的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1007_p", "source_sha256": "32b273d526ff185c13e84f0e546e2c82851f61d1fb36305e961a25fba0a1e664", "ja": "それならいいんだけど……急に屋上に\n呼び出したりするから、何かあったのかと思ったよ。", "zh": "那就好……只是你突然把我叫到屋顶来，我还以为发生什么事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "82bb104f559776134bb9fd46983e6b4ef355fd29031fe72729e235d419419626", "ja": "心配してくれたのか？\nそんな弱気じゃ、あんたのほうが心配だな。", "zh": "你是在担心我吗？\n这么没底气，我反倒更担心你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ec4cbfecde29dd93f78482cc9c72ce9d2ea8cc78dc6620cd7bb3ebf6c62fd45d", "ja": "はは、そうかもしれないな。\nけど、元気ならよかった。", "zh": "哈哈，说不定真是这样。\n不过，你有精神就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "8b74ae792e9170460b32dde882940bc1712685dcaa284b9b0db3d8d69890504e", "ja": "あんたって本当に、変なやつだよな。\n心配性なくせに、急に大胆な行動に出たりするし……。", "zh": "你这人还真是奇怪啊。明明那么爱操心，却又会突然采取大胆的行动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "c1985efb126b7fdbbcfc6cf237372e5c4a381cbfd002113712c94e58230068e8", "ja": "でも……プロデューサーのあんたが、あたしと\n真剣に向き合ってくれてることは、わかるよ。", "zh": "不过……我明白，作为制作人的你，一直都在认真面对我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1012_p", "source_sha256": "98b7e3ed3432d5db0d632484b60babd3f79a0e6ed9f704205a78209306e4ca4d", "ja": "ジュリア……。", "zh": "茱莉亚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "77e5cf6e2e651ca897ffabbff14e3eedd3c5ae800f832a2daf96d9f8fea603a0", "ja": "あたしはまだ、自分が思ってるより子どもみたいだ。\n……だから真っ直ぐなあんたの言葉が、届く。", "zh": "我好像还比自己以为的更像个孩子。\n……所以，你那直率的话语才能传到我心里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "199bc3b9cfd34f7a6cac88363874e7d86f6e6f79dbad79b71b40eacc0ce12c59", "ja": "他でもない、あんたとだから……あたしも、\n素直に夢を見ていられるのかもな。", "zh": "正因为是和你一起……我也许才能坦率地做着梦吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4f0fde9490e5cb9d2439e0cc09ee216a8aacb9dd78faabf7731efed263617d95", "ja": "そうか。……少しでもジュリアの\n役に立ててるなら、良かったよ。", "zh": "这样啊。……只要能帮上茱莉亚哪怕一点忙，\n那就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "7abd286c82679fa548f531e236a31a09d3c563ab2b8d70316dc693b32af368ca", "ja": "ああ。アンタがいなかったら、あたしは\n少なくともアイドルにはなってなかったし……。", "zh": "啊。要是没有你，我至少不会成为偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "7f942b9e80bfab1b8e9e2c1eca53b475615065d38d4a5e035df759e7b05e9053", "ja": "ん？　それって結局、{$P$}が\n非常識だってことになるのか……？", "zh": "嗯？这样说到底，岂不是成了\n{$P$}不按常理出牌了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1018_p", "source_sha256": "7ade517feb12a3e8376097cb0c33fb9d9baf7fa700ac1c1e53a92b198c3427fc", "ja": "その言い方だと、ちっとも褒められてるように\n聞こえないんだけど……まぁいいか。", "zh": "这种说法听起来可完全不像是在夸我……不过，算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0163_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "97f3539d4c4f19650cdbf42e6a211c88f2c3ac58a99388f056597a1ad0dfa945", "ja": "ははっ、細かいことは気にするなって。\nこれからもよろしく頼むぜ、バカP♪", "zh": "哈哈，别在意那些细节啦。今后也拜托你了，笨蛋P♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
